WEBVTT

00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:03.900
We've finally got our stolen coords back!

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:05.500
Isn't that great?!

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:06.790
Let's snap! Let's snap!

00:00:06.790 --> 00:00:07.860
Okay.

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:12.100
This is the entertainment news.

00:00:12.510 --> 00:00:17.790
Internationally famous movie star and winner of the title best prince,

00:00:17.790 --> 00:00:22.000
Shikyouin Hibiki-san, has revealed that she is actually a girl.

00:01:53.960 --> 00:01:57.800
The Fabulous Daily Life of Shikyouin Hibiki.

00:01:58.970 --> 00:02:04.720
Hibiki-san has made her idol début at PriPara, the female only idol themeworld.

00:02:04.720 --> 00:02:08.390
For fans of hers in EuroPara, Pamerica, Aprica, Pasia,

00:02:08.390 --> 00:02:13.590
and others around the world, this has come as a big shock.

00:02:18.280 --> 00:02:18.960
Great!

00:02:18.960 --> 00:02:20.010
Keep it coming!

00:02:20.010 --> 00:02:21.990
That's great, Hibiki-chan!

00:02:22.640 --> 00:02:25.200
I've taken the Tears of Yuliya as promised!

00:02:25.510 --> 00:02:27.240
Now good day, gentlemen!

00:02:27.560 --> 00:02:28.580
And cut!

00:02:36.460 --> 00:02:37.550
Hibiki-san!

00:02:37.550 --> 00:02:39.010
A word for your fans!

00:02:39.010 --> 00:02:41.010
Why have you disguised yourself as a man?

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:42.360
Are you really a girl?

00:02:42.360 --> 00:02:45.320
Why did you make your PriPara début now?

00:02:45.320 --> 00:02:47.310
My PriPara début?

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:48.520
You've got it backwards.

00:02:48.820 --> 00:02:52.790
PriPara has finally met Shikyouin Hibiki.

00:02:52.790 --> 00:02:55.710
You'll understand once I finish dyeing it in my colour.

00:02:55.710 --> 00:02:57.860
And that will be its revolution.

00:02:58.480 --> 00:03:02.870
This is the third straight day that Shikyouin Hibiki has been at the top of the search team rankings.

00:03:04.310 --> 00:03:06.960
Why is someone like her so popular?!

00:03:06.960 --> 00:03:09.040
I'm way cuter!

00:03:09.360 --> 00:03:11.550
It's probably cause she's a well known star.

00:03:11.550 --> 00:03:14.470
She also has a detailed online profile.

00:03:14.470 --> 00:03:16.820
She made her début as a male model at the age of seven.

00:03:16.820 --> 00:03:18.920
And ever since then, she's been described as a prodigy young actor...

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:21.510
...and has come to be known as best prince.

00:03:21.510 --> 00:03:22.600
Oh?

00:03:22.600 --> 00:03:25.170
So she's been playing a boy for a long time.

00:03:25.170 --> 00:03:28.220
But why has she been doing that despite being a girl?

00:03:29.440 --> 00:03:35.400
Hibiki-san revealed that she is Phantom Thief Genius when she made her début,

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:39.280
and indicated that her intention is to change the face of PriPara for the better.

00:03:39.950 --> 00:03:41.660
In later comments,

00:03:41.660 --> 00:03:47.580
she mentioned that everything is dependant on the
outcome of the upcoming Winter Dream Idol GrandPrix.

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:50.880
If the team Hibiki-san puts together happens to win,

00:03:50.880 --> 00:03:53.000
all of her previous crimes will be overlooked,

00:03:53.010 --> 00:03:58.380
and there's a chance she'll be allowed to dictate the future of PriPara's policies.

00:03:58.380 --> 00:03:59.290
No way!

00:03:59.290 --> 00:04:01.750
We'll win and force her to apologise!

00:04:01.750 --> 00:04:02.230
Yeah!

00:04:02.230 --> 00:04:03.580
There's no way we'll lose!

00:04:03.580 --> 00:04:05.110
We got it!

00:04:05.110 --> 00:04:08.590
But her concert was really impressive.

00:04:08.590 --> 00:04:10.240
As were her wings.

00:04:12.030 --> 00:04:16.390
<i>We certainly made a rash decision when she challenged us,</i>

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:18.480
<i>but...</i>

00:04:18.480 --> 00:04:20.010
We can win.

00:04:20.010 --> 00:04:20.940
Huh?

00:04:21.420 --> 00:04:26.160
All of the members who Airy Changed at the Dream Theatre gained wings.

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:27.410
And...

00:04:27.640 --> 00:04:29.120
And?!

00:04:29.770 --> 00:04:32.080
...we have Manaka-san's burning inner strength.

00:04:32.570 --> 00:04:36.830
Whenever we're in peril, she has a strange potential that manifests.

00:04:37.030 --> 00:04:39.280
That time, and that other time...

00:04:39.280 --> 00:04:41.640
I'm sure I saw that power.

00:04:42.540 --> 00:04:43.160
H-Huh?

00:04:43.160 --> 00:04:45.130
You sure?

00:04:45.130 --> 00:04:47.020
I am.

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:49.320
And on top of that, we're hard working.

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:53.440
"Genius is 1% talent and 99% percent hard work" - Einstein.

00:04:53.440 --> 00:04:55.390
If they come at us with a team of prodigies,

00:04:55.390 --> 00:04:58.360
we'll be fine with an average team that is hard working!

00:04:58.360 --> 00:04:59.430
Yeah!

00:04:59.430 --> 00:05:00.800
Capisce!

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:02.000
Wait.

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:04.650
Actually, where are Sophie-san and Shion-san?

00:05:04.650 --> 00:05:05.470
Haven't a clue.

00:05:05.470 --> 00:05:07.340
Didn't they have something come up?

00:05:11.470 --> 00:05:13.930
Please pardon my appearance.

00:05:13.930 --> 00:05:17.170
I have a boring party I must attend shortly.

00:05:17.520 --> 00:05:19.730
Why did you call us?

00:05:19.730 --> 00:05:20.380
Yeah?

00:05:22.360 --> 00:05:28.340
As I'm sure you know, I'm forming a team of prodigies for the upcoming WinDrea.

00:05:28.670 --> 00:05:31.330
Houjou Sophie, Toudou Shion,

00:05:31.330 --> 00:05:35.060
I am formally inviting you to join my team.

00:05:37.550 --> 00:05:41.730
The looks on your faces tell me that you are unsure of how to answer.

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:43.350
But it's simple if you ask me.

00:05:43.960 --> 00:05:45.950
You just need to be honest with yourselves.

00:05:45.950 --> 00:05:47.150
What?

00:05:47.390 --> 00:05:50.120
You saw my concert, didn't you?

00:05:50.120 --> 00:05:53.080
And the sparkle of my wings as I flew...?

00:05:54.380 --> 00:05:59.340
I'm sure you thought "I also want to try putting on a flying concert like that".

00:05:59.340 --> 00:06:00.260
How do you know that?

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:03.370
A prodigy knows a prodigy when she sees one.

00:06:03.620 --> 00:06:09.360
As we're prodigies, a reaction unlike anything anyone has ever seen will take place as we sing together.

00:06:09.820 --> 00:06:14.410
And then we'll be able to witness a scene no one has seen before.

00:06:15.530 --> 00:06:18.150
A scene no one has seen before?

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:20.330
I understand what you're talking about.

00:06:20.330 --> 00:06:22.250
But your comments are useless.

00:06:22.250 --> 00:06:24.170
I've decided to do things my way.

00:06:24.170 --> 00:06:25.480
That's fine.

00:06:25.480 --> 00:06:28.510
I'm sure you'll join me eventually.

00:06:36.620 --> 00:06:38.160
What did you think?

00:06:38.530 --> 00:06:39.940
Something like...

00:06:40.370 --> 00:06:41.110
Pushuu~.

00:06:41.110 --> 00:06:43.590
I'm swimming along thinking I'm a jellyfish,

00:06:43.590 --> 00:06:47.300
then she says "you are a mushroom",

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:49.730
even though I'm a jellyfish.

00:06:49.730 --> 00:06:53.330
Then are cloud ear mushrooms jellyfish? Or mushrooms?

00:06:53.710 --> 00:06:56.420
That kind of feeling.

00:06:56.800 --> 00:06:58.390
I can't relate.

00:07:02.710 --> 00:07:08.320
Arresting Phantom Thief Genius is entirely dependent upon the outcome of the WinDrea.

00:07:08.620 --> 00:07:12.910
It's unfortunate that we weren't able to achieve anything as the PriPara Police.

00:07:13.220 --> 00:07:16.790
As of today, the special investigation team is being disbanded.

00:07:16.790 --> 00:07:19.500
Degas!

00:07:19.770 --> 00:07:23.010
How deeply regrettable-daVinci!

00:07:23.010 --> 00:07:26.710
I will be returning to my normal job of supporting the idols here.

00:07:27.020 --> 00:07:29.010
Ham-senpai and the rest of you,

00:07:29.270 --> 00:07:34.100
please continue to protect the peace within this town as part of the PriPara Police.

00:07:34.100 --> 00:07:35.100
Poan!

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:36.000
Pan!

00:07:36.810 --> 00:07:39.680
Here's your SummDrea ticket.

00:07:39.910 --> 00:07:41.350
Thanks.

00:07:41.540 --> 00:07:44.150
I'm glad that you're doing better than I expected.

00:07:44.890 --> 00:07:49.530
<i>It must have been quite a shock to find out the guy she admired was actually a girl.</i>

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:53.070
Get better soon so we can perform together again!

00:07:53.300 --> 00:07:54.300
I will!

00:07:55.450 --> 00:07:57.160
All right, see you later.

00:08:29.110 --> 00:08:31.340
How are you doing, Fuwari-tori?

00:08:31.340 --> 00:08:32.190
Toriko-san.

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:34.880
It was quite the shock, wasn't it-tori?

00:08:34.880 --> 00:08:39.470
Since Toriko is your manager, you ended up getting hurt-tori!

00:08:39.470 --> 00:08:42.160
That means Toriko is a terrible manager-tori!

00:08:42.430 --> 00:08:43.710
Don't worry.

00:08:43.710 --> 00:08:44.870
I love you, Toriko-san.

00:08:45.200 --> 00:08:47.450
Then please listen to Toriko's request-tori!

00:08:47.450 --> 00:08:51.430
Please go outside and get a breath of fresh air soon-tori!

00:08:51.430 --> 00:08:52.840
Okay.

00:08:55.110 --> 00:08:55.800
Andou?

00:08:56.260 --> 00:08:58.790
I have a half hour gap in my schedule.

00:08:58.790 --> 00:09:00.510
Is my horse ready?

00:09:00.820 --> 00:09:03.020
My apologies, Hibiki-sama.

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:07.180
Maxi actually jumped over the high school riding club's fence...

00:09:23.240 --> 00:09:24.660
Maxi!

00:09:25.900 --> 00:09:27.880
Did you come to see me?

00:09:30.820 --> 00:09:32.890
I'm glad I came outside.

00:09:33.840 --> 00:09:35.260
Maxi.

00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:45.850
I told you not to come here, did I not?

00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:48.810
All right, let's head back.

00:09:51.310 --> 00:09:52.850
Hibiki-san.

00:09:53.530 --> 00:09:57.140
I'm, um... shocked.

00:09:57.140 --> 00:10:00.080
Not only are you Phantom Thief Genius,

00:10:00.080 --> 00:10:03.380
but you're also a girl.

00:10:03.380 --> 00:10:06.750
I understand you even less now.

00:10:06.750 --> 00:10:10.460
You've told me so many things.

00:10:11.140 --> 00:10:14.670
But which parts were true and which were lies?

00:10:15.900 --> 00:10:17.880
As if I'd lie to you.

00:10:17.880 --> 00:10:18.840
Huh?

00:10:23.270 --> 00:10:25.520
Fuwari, I was only ever...

00:10:26.270 --> 00:10:27.480
...in love with you.

00:10:32.130 --> 00:10:33.550
Did you take that seriously?

00:10:33.550 --> 00:10:34.110
What?!

00:10:35.180 --> 00:10:38.240
To me, a performance like this is an everyday thing.

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:41.930
It's easy to trick a country girl from the Palps.

00:10:41.930 --> 00:10:45.700
Would you like me to whisper more passionate words in your ear?

00:10:54.170 --> 00:10:55.400
How rude.

00:10:56.880 --> 00:10:58.880
She's in bed again-tori?!

00:10:58.880 --> 00:11:01.110
It must be Toriko's fault-tori!

00:11:03.620 --> 00:11:07.870
Hibiki-san, are you planing on continuing your career as a girl from here on out?

00:11:07.870 --> 00:11:11.060
I'll continue doing things the way I want just like I always have.

00:11:11.440 --> 00:11:17.110
I heard that you are playing the role of a girl dressed as a guy in your next movie.

00:11:17.110 --> 00:11:19.530
We've already started rehearsals.

00:11:19.910 --> 00:11:22.490
I hope all of you enjoy it.

00:11:22.490 --> 00:11:23.660
For crying out loud!

00:11:23.660 --> 00:11:25.950
I've heard enough about Hibiki!

00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:28.400
Why aren't they going on about Dorothy this and Dorothy that?!

00:11:28.400 --> 00:11:31.140
I have something I'd like to ask you, Dorothy.

00:11:31.140 --> 00:11:32.370
Huh?

00:11:34.770 --> 00:11:36.460
Hibiki-chan!

00:11:36.730 --> 00:11:38.960
You're a beautiful hunk again today!

00:11:38.960 --> 00:11:41.510
Well, this time you're a Knight of Persailles.

00:11:41.510 --> 00:11:45.430
Who would have thought this would be the perfect movie for you right now.

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:47.930
You're going to gain more fans again, aren't you?!

00:11:48.320 --> 00:11:49.330
Excuse me.

00:11:49.330 --> 00:11:57.070
It seems we'll be starting late as the flight for Barazono Yuri-san, our heroine, has been delayed about an hour.

00:11:57.070 --> 00:11:57.640
Huh?!

00:11:57.640 --> 00:12:00.120
Even if she did win a Parademy Award,

00:12:00.120 --> 00:12:03.180
she's a bitch for making Hibiki-chan wait.

00:12:03.180 --> 00:12:03.950
Ouch!

00:12:03.950 --> 00:12:04.930
I'm sorry!

00:12:04.930 --> 00:12:07.240
Hibiki-chan, please be a darling and wait an hour.

00:12:07.240 --> 00:12:09.170
I am not used to waiting.

00:12:10.390 --> 00:12:12.440
Reschedule the rehearsal for another day.

00:12:12.440 --> 00:12:14.050
Wait, Hibiki-chan!

00:12:14.050 --> 00:12:15.830
Why not?!

00:12:15.830 --> 00:12:16.010
Let me go!

00:12:16.010 --> 00:12:17.790
Shut it!

00:12:17.790 --> 00:12:18.300
Let me go!

00:12:18.710 --> 00:12:20.240
<i>Dorothy West,</i>

00:12:20.240 --> 00:12:22.510
<i>and her younger brother Leona West...</i>

00:12:22.990 --> 00:12:24.680
<i>What are they up to?</i>

00:12:33.740 --> 00:12:36.730
And here I thought we could sneak in and surprise you.

00:12:36.730 --> 00:12:38.860
Do you know these people, Shikyouin-san?

00:12:38.860 --> 00:12:40.700
Nope. Please toss them out.

00:12:40.700 --> 00:12:43.940
Eh? That's not nice, Mage-chan.

00:12:43.940 --> 00:12:45.160
Um...

00:12:45.360 --> 00:12:48.280
Why do you dress up like a guy?

00:12:49.980 --> 00:12:53.350
That's what I wanted to know.

00:12:53.350 --> 00:12:55.710
I wanted to see what you're normally like.

00:12:57.410 --> 00:12:58.990
<i>Leona West...</i>

00:12:59.310 --> 00:13:02.380
<i>It's said that the goddesses of PriPara have made exception for this idol.</i>

00:13:02.700 --> 00:13:05.090
<i>He doesn't look the least bit manly.</i>

00:13:05.390 --> 00:13:08.100
<i>But he did chase my smash once.</i>

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:10.790
Cheer up, Hibiki-chan.

00:13:10.790 --> 00:13:13.540
The programme after this needs you Hibiki-chan.

00:13:13.540 --> 00:13:14.560
Why not.

00:13:14.560 --> 00:13:15.690
Yahoo!

00:13:15.690 --> 00:13:18.060
However, it would be boring to just wait around.

00:13:18.060 --> 00:13:18.770
Huh?

00:13:19.080 --> 00:13:22.990
Why don't we use a stand-in until my co-star arrives?

00:13:22.990 --> 00:13:24.740
Huh? A stand-in?

00:13:25.460 --> 00:13:26.490
Her!

00:13:26.490 --> 00:13:27.160
Huh?!

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:28.820
What?!

00:13:29.140 --> 00:13:32.580
I'll answer your question if you be our stand-in.

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:34.040
I'll do it.

00:13:38.450 --> 00:13:40.020
As I said earlier,

00:13:40.020 --> 00:13:43.750
this rehearsal is for practice and to check lighting,

00:13:43.750 --> 00:13:46.510
so you just need to match the mood.

00:13:46.880 --> 00:13:49.120
Now let's have fun.

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:52.970
Okay, "Knight of Persailles" act 2, scene 2,

00:13:52.970 --> 00:13:56.190
the scene where our knight rescues the princess from the pirate ship.

00:13:56.190 --> 00:13:57.560
Action!

00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:00.530
Why am I dressed like this?!

00:14:00.530 --> 00:14:02.270
Why am I the pirate?!

00:14:02.270 --> 00:14:04.100
There's no way there's a pirate cuter than me!

00:14:04.640 --> 00:14:06.500
Cut it out! Stop!

00:14:07.000 --> 00:14:08.500
Action!

00:14:09.360 --> 00:14:12.030
Princess, I am glad thou art safe!

00:14:12.670 --> 00:14:16.750
I hath travelled these stormy seas upon the call to rescue you!

00:14:17.150 --> 00:14:19.960
I will not let thee pass into the hands of these pirates!

00:14:22.030 --> 00:14:24.450
W-Why have you come?

00:14:24.450 --> 00:14:26.550
Flee while you still can!

00:14:28.310 --> 00:14:30.860
And leave you in this place?!

00:14:30.860 --> 00:14:33.470
I would rather throw myself to the sea!

00:14:33.690 --> 00:14:35.680
And now the pirate's line!

00:14:35.680 --> 00:14:37.330
Let's see...

00:14:37.330 --> 00:14:38.860
The princess is escaping!

00:14:38.860 --> 00:14:40.950
Don't let her get away!

00:14:40.950 --> 00:14:42.680
...what's with this line?!

00:14:42.680 --> 00:14:44.400
Bring out the director and screenwriter!

00:14:44.680 --> 00:14:46.420
We're out of time!

00:14:46.420 --> 00:14:47.860
Here, take my hand!

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:52.830
I'm not leaving.

00:14:54.130 --> 00:14:56.790
Because I know the truth.

00:14:57.410 --> 00:15:00.730
Your true side... your false love.

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:03.750
The words you whisper with those lips...

00:15:04.390 --> 00:15:07.210
That hand you gently extend to me...

00:15:07.860 --> 00:15:11.380
I finally understand that they're all a lie!

00:15:13.150 --> 00:15:14.640
<i>Oh?</i>

00:15:14.640 --> 00:15:16.950
That female stand in is pretty good.

00:15:16.950 --> 00:15:18.180
She's pretty, too.

00:15:18.180 --> 00:15:19.850
All right, your line, pirate!

00:15:19.850 --> 00:15:21.650
The princess is escaping!

00:15:21.650 --> 00:15:23.860
Don't let her get away!

00:15:25.160 --> 00:15:28.070
You're actually a girl, aren't you?

00:15:28.600 --> 00:15:32.030
Yet, why do you dress like that?

00:15:36.260 --> 00:15:37.820
Why, you ask?

00:15:37.820 --> 00:15:41.020
This world is a lie-a farce- you see.

00:15:41.020 --> 00:15:42.540
So what, pray tell, is the problem?

00:15:42.740 --> 00:15:43.540
Eh?

00:15:43.750 --> 00:15:45.400
H-Huh?

00:15:45.400 --> 00:15:47.760
"Due to family circumstances, I was raised as a man"...

00:15:47.760 --> 00:15:49.720
...is the line she should have said.

00:15:50.270 --> 00:15:51.170
How about you?

00:15:51.170 --> 00:15:52.180
Me?!

00:15:52.510 --> 00:15:54.140
What about yourself?

00:15:55.860 --> 00:15:57.260
I...

00:16:01.570 --> 00:16:03.400
I'm fine as I am!

00:16:03.640 --> 00:16:04.900
I see.

00:16:05.360 --> 00:16:07.270
That's not her line!

00:16:07.270 --> 00:16:08.290
You okay with this?

00:16:08.290 --> 00:16:10.140
Shut it!

00:16:10.140 --> 00:16:13.140
I've come up with a great idea!

00:16:16.670 --> 00:16:19.340
Even if I have to turn the heavens against me,

00:16:19.340 --> 00:16:21.410
I will do anything to protect you!

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:24.600
Even if I must sacrifice myself, My Princess!

00:16:25.250 --> 00:16:28.350
What do you think you're doing to Leona?!

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:31.110
Dorothy!

00:16:31.110 --> 00:16:33.260
Hey, don't I have a cannon or something?!

00:16:33.260 --> 00:16:34.890
Fire! Fire! Fire!

00:16:35.080 --> 00:16:36.430
Let's get out of here, Leona.

00:16:36.430 --> 00:16:37.850
I can't handle this jerk any longer-

00:16:42.130 --> 00:16:44.750
Barazono-san has arrived!

00:16:46.940 --> 00:16:49.620
That hurt! You idiot!

00:16:49.620 --> 00:16:52.110
Thanks for coming with me, Dorothy.

00:16:52.860 --> 00:16:56.760
I thought Hibiki-san and I were the same,

00:16:56.760 --> 00:16:58.580
but it seems we also have our differences.

00:16:58.780 --> 00:16:59.780
How?!

00:16:59.780 --> 00:17:01.660
You're not obnoxious like her!

00:17:01.660 --> 00:17:04.820
She's just naturally disagreeable!

00:17:05.530 --> 00:17:06.500
That fraud!

00:17:07.530 --> 00:17:11.090
Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.

00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:14.180
Coord Change Start!

00:17:15.660 --> 00:17:20.440
An aristocratic vampire's coord must be made up of dark and chic colours!

00:17:20.440 --> 00:17:22.120
It looks very good, doesn't it?

00:17:22.120 --> 00:17:23.680
Vampire Rose Coord!

00:17:27.980 --> 00:17:31.970
After her début concert, Hibiki-san was ranked a Celebrity Idol in Top Rank,

00:17:31.970 --> 00:17:35.740
and became the highest ranking idol in PriPara!

00:17:35.740 --> 00:17:38.660
Please look forward to another concert from this prodigy!

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:13.960
Making Drama Switch On!

00:19:15.930 --> 00:19:16.970
Go for it!

00:19:19.960 --> 00:19:21.840
I will protect it!

00:19:22.760 --> 00:19:24.350
Sapphire Revolution:

00:19:25.190 --> 00:19:27.630
Wild Dance of Innocence!

00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:32.020
Sacrifices must be made for the revolution!

00:19:34.930 --> 00:19:37.260
Airy Change!

00:19:42.010 --> 00:19:43.660
Golden Airy!

00:20:17.330 --> 00:20:19.980
Hibiki-san is yellow; Celebrity.

00:20:19.980 --> 00:20:21.820
It fits her perfectly, doesn't it?

00:20:22.130 --> 00:20:23.550
Amazing...

00:20:23.550 --> 00:20:25.780
A scene never seen before...

00:20:26.130 --> 00:20:27.670
I'll definitely beat her!

00:20:27.670 --> 00:20:29.030
Don't worry.

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:32.000
We're all here with you, Dorothy.

00:20:32.290 --> 00:20:33.900
That's right.

00:20:33.900 --> 00:20:35.600
As long as we're together, we can't lose!

00:20:35.600 --> 00:20:38.210
She may be formidable, but we'll definitely win-pri!

00:20:38.470 --> 00:20:39.550
Yeah!

00:22:16.180 --> 00:22:18.600
Whether to join Shikyouin's team or not...

00:22:18.600 --> 00:22:20.900
A quick decision must be made!

00:22:21.100 --> 00:22:24.900
What kind of scenery did she mean by a scene no one has seen before?

00:22:24.900 --> 00:22:27.150
The answer exists within me.

00:22:27.150 --> 00:22:27.980
Next time:

00:22:27.980 --> 00:22:29.840
Go'ing My Way!
